	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Search the contacts imported with contacts-cli.

Type "contacts" and a name, number, email or organisation.
Enter copies the number. ⌘↩ messages it with the app chosen in the workflow settings (Signal, WhatsApp, SMS, ...). ⇧↩ emails the contact.

Needs contacts-cli: brew install quintrino/tap/contacts-cli, then contacts-cli import contacts.csv.
https://github.com/quintrino/alfred-contacts-cli-workflow</string>
